Package: roadmappeR
Title: Readiness Level Roadmaps 
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Valentin", "Geiger", , "geiger@westbor.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Simple tool for start-ups to plan and track readiness levels 
    (TRL, MRL, FRL and any other track) on one timeline. Corresponding 
    milestones are stored in a plain CSV file.Timeline is displayed as
    an interactive timeline. A R shiny app lets you move milestones by 
    dragging. HTML snapshots of the current status can be exported.
